
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>NusaraCommerce | Privacy Policy</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Privacy Policy for NusaraCommerce marketing automation.">
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      max-width: 850px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      padding: 0 22px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #243047;
      background: #f8fafc;
    }
    header {
      background: #3b82f6;
      color: white;
      padding: 28px;
      border-radius: 14px;
    }
    main {
      background: white;
      padding: 28px;
      margin-top: 20px;
      border-radius: 14px;
    }
    h2 { color: #2563eb; }
    a { color: #2563eb; }
    footer { margin: 24px 0; font-size: 14px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>NusaraCommerce</h1>
    <p>Privacy Policy</p>
  </header>

  <main>
    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> 25 October 2026</p>

    <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
    <p>
      This Privacy Policy explains how NusaraCommerce handles information
      when managing marketing content for its digital educational products.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Information We Process</h2>
    <p>
      Our marketing workflow may process product names, public Etsy listing
      URLs, Pinterest Pin titles, descriptions, keywords, image ideas and
      account information made available through authorized integrations.
    </p>

    <h2>3. How We Use Information</h2>
    <p>
      We use relevant information to prepare, review and manage promotional
      content for NusaraCommerce products. Content is reviewed before
      publication.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>
      Our workflow may use Etsy, Pinterest, n8n and Google Sheets.
      These services process information according to their own terms
      and privacy policies.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Data Security and Retention</h2>
    <p>
      We take reasonable steps to protect information and credentials
      used in our workflow. Information is retained only as reasonably
      necessary for the purposes described here and applicable obligations.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Privacy Requests</h2>
    <p>
      For questions about this policy or information handled by
      NusaraCommerce, please contact us using the business contact
      information provided in our Etsy shop.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      Our marketing workflow is intended to promote educational products.
      It is not designed to collect personal information directly from children.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Policy Updates</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this policy when our practices change. The latest
      version will be published on this page.
    </p>

    <h2>9. Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Business: NusaraCommerce<br>
      Etsy shop:
      <a href="https://www.etsy.com/shop/NusaraCommerce">
        NusaraCommerce on Etsy
      </a>
    </p>
  </main>

  <footer>
    &copy; 2026 NusaraCommerce
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
